  "developmentCorrections": [
    "One direct stage test incorrectly counted slot reservation as an IR instruction; expected count corrected from six to four. Independent raw-copy comparisons already passed; no production correction was needed for that test.",
    "Extraction owner 16 must fail like the raw record reader, while materialization uses 16 as a constructor sentinel. Separate extraction mode 7 preserves this boundary; exact raw error and prefix comparison added at ee8d50c.",
    "Engine returned_ranges failed during input compilation with syntax kind 2 at offset 118: aggregate interception ran before close-token lexer_work completed. d4bc8ba prioritizes lexical work before all result finalization. Added raw malformed-after-close and real close-token/view-request protocol regressions; the temporary C isolation experiment was diagnostic only and is not counted as final verification.",
    "Combined release verification hit the pinned MSVC 60-second compile limit before test execution. Split the view protocol into a separate test function and verified release in 7+10 batches: 17 executions, 14 unique groups, identical production bytes. No timeout, compiler or stack override."
  ],
